<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione all'espressione testuale che produce. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to the textual expression it produces. The original property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R17 created"@en .
